=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Duberasson} at H-11 in {z:Western Adoulin} (he is near the residential area, right next to {p:Eternal Flame}, the NPC who deals in {p:Sparks}).
* Talk to {n:Nantoto} at H-8 in {z:Lower Jeuno}. {n:Nantoto} will offer various letters.
** The letters she offers are based on the number of unique {p:Records of Eminence|RoE} objectives you have completed.
*** Each letter will offer a new objective that you can set under "RoE Quests".
* The objective asks you to "Outfit yourself with a certain shield after wresting it from the hands of the villain who stole it, then examine the records of an individual who thought constantly of Ouschrahd."
** Obtain and equip a {i:Mahogany Shield|Mahogany Shield|12292}.
** Travel to the Stone Monument at (E-12) in {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)} and examine it.

=2 Notes
* 473 was the total number of {p:RoE} objectives in the game (not counting Go With the Flow itself) at the time when this RoE Quest was added, May 2014.
* Ouschrahd is the name of an island, given the context in the quest.

